  "process": "docs/release/visual-baselines.md",
  "note": "DoD 23 — every pixel baseline in the repo, declared. A baseline that appears without an entry here was never reviewed by a person; an entry without a file means a case lost its baseline and the next run silently writes a fresh one. tooling/check-visual-regression.mjs fails on either."
